OL,5,G0300 A Kestrel for a Knave by Barry
OL,6,G     Hines
OL,7,     F4 Extra Debut. In a raw, mean
OL,8,     Ftown, a boy turns to the one thing
OL,9,     Fhe can trust. A kestrel. Her name
OL,10,     Fis Kes. Stars David Brierley.
OL,11,G0400 The Billy Cotton Band Show
OL,12,     F4 Extra Debut. Music and comedy
OL,13,     Fstarring Mr Wakey-Wakey himself,
OL,14,     FBilly Cotton and his band. With
OL,15,     FFreddie and The Dreamers. From
OL,16,     F1963.
OL,17,G0430 Kind Hearts and Coronets
OL,18,     F4 Extra Debut. Following the death
OL,19,     Fof his mother, Louis Mazzini seeks
OL,20,     Frevenge against the d'Ascoyne
OL,21,     Ffamily. Starring Robert Powell.
